@startuml
autonumber

actor Operator
participant "Location search view" as Search
participant "Local geography index" as Index
participant "Navigation workflow" as Navigation
participant "Map rendering boundary" as Map

Operator -> Search: Expand search
Operator -> Search: Type query
Search -> Search: Debounce input
Search -> Index: Search names, aliases, codes, and paths
Index --> Search: Ordered propositions
Search --> Operator: Show full-path propositions

Operator -> Search: Pause pointer on proposition
Search -> Navigation: Begin temporary preview
Navigation -> Navigation: Save committed navigation state
Navigation -> Map: Preview region, layers, breadcrumbs, extent
Operator -> Search: Move pointer away
Search -> Navigation: End temporary preview
Navigation -> Map: Restore saved navigation state with hop

Operator -> Search: Click proposition / press Enter
Search -> Navigation: Commit region selection
Navigation -> Map: Select region, update layers/breadcrumbs, choose transition, fit view
Search --> Operator: Close proposition list
@enduml
